ciation Alumni Events Alumni FAQs Columbia Community Open Columbia Community Event Spaces Goodall Gallery Women's Business Center Community Engagement Mascot Program Breadcrumb Home Faculty & Staff Faculty & Staff Reach your potential in the areas of teaching, research, and service while achieving the vision and mission of the institution. Quicklinks Koala Connection Canvas Login Faculty & Staff Directory Campus Map Academic Calendar Academic Bulletin Professional Growth Faculty are the foundation of the great work done for the students at Columbia College. The college is committed to building a culture of learning and professional growth for all faculty. Year-long program of support for first-year faculty Monthly professional development sessions for all faculty and staff Faculty Workshop series at the beginning of each semester Tenure and Promotion Writing Workshops each summer Financial support for professional activities through faculty development grants Opportunities for leadership within programs and across campus Peer Mentoring Learning Communities Monthly Technology Tips Integrated Information Literacy personalized support for course development and faculty research Specialized Adjunct orientation resources Community We also focus on personal self-care, wellness, and community-building. Weekly community lunch Monthly health and wellness activities Monthly faculty and staff coffee End-of-semester celebrations Summer campus community picnic Off-campus faculty social time following faculty meetings Access to fitness facilities and scheduled classes Upcoming Faculty & Staff Events Sep 10 2026 Event Convocation 2026 September 10, 2026, 12:30 - 1:30pm Join us on Thursday, September 10, at 12:30 PM at College Place Chapel for our annual Academic Convocation. This traditional event commemorates the... Event Details » Sep 25 2026 Event Family and Friends Weekend 2026 September 25 - 26, 2026, All day Columbia College Family and Friends Weekend 💜 There’s nothing like 