 Association Alumni Events Alumni FAQs Columbia Community Open Columbia Community Event Spaces Goodall Gallery Women's Business Center Community Engagement Mascot Program Breadcrumb Home Alumni Give Faculty/Staff Giving Faculty & Staff Giving Campaign At Columbia College, our faculty, staff, and administrators are the heart of our community. While you already dedicate your time, talent, and passion to our students, the Faculty and Staff Giving Campaign offers another powerful way to show your support. This initiative presents an opportunity to make a financial contribution that directly impacts the student experience. Every gift, no matter the size, helps create new academic opportunities and experiences that shape the future of our students and campus. Your generosity paves the way for innovation, growth, and excellence. It is a testament to the belief you have in our mission and the students we serve. You are our greatest advocates, and this campaign is a celebration of your unwavering commitment. This year's campaign launches on September 1st and continues throughout the month. Our goal is to achieve 100% participation by the end of September. By joining together, we can make this our most impactful campaign yet. Let's show our students what the power of giving can accomplish! Ways to Give Payroll Deduction Set up a monthly gift to the college to be automatically deducted from your paycheck each month. Completion of the paper pledge form or online payroll deduction form will allow you to set-up one of the following deduction plans: Loyal for Life is a continuous gift until you authorize us to stop or alter your pledge. One-year pledge is a 12-month gift and will terminate after one year. Payroll Deduction Form Credit/Debit Card Donation Make a one-time or recurring gift through the College’s online donation form. Online Donation Form Koala Community Current Students Open Current Students Registrar Open Registrar Academic Calendar Commencement Graduation Requirements Student Affairs Open Student Affairs Diversity, Equity & Inclusion Counseling & Case Management Bookstore & Koala Pantry Campus Information Open Campus Information Facilities Request Campus Safety Tuition Payments Faculty & Staff Parents & Families Alumni Open Alumni Give Open Give Faculty/Staff Giving Donor Recognition Planned Giving 50th Reunion Giving Alumni Association Alumni Events Alumni FAQs Columbia Community Open Columbia Community Event Spaces Goodall Gallery Women's Business Center Community Engagement Mascot Program Coumbia College 800.277.1301 1301 Columbia College Drive Columbia, SC 29203 Directions Campus Map Footer Current Students Academic Calendar Academic Bulletin Koala Connection Login Canvas Login Webmail Accessibility Quick Links Directory Employment Library Registrar Compliance Privacy Social Links Facebook Instagram Linkedin Twitter Youtube Legal Compliance Privacy Policy Copyright © 2026 Columbia College. Website by Cyberwoven . Sitemap"
